@startuml
' A dictation with a spoken instruction, in Spanish. The structure is in
' spoken-instruction.iuml; UI terms as in
' src/i18n/locales/es/translation.json.
' "\n" breaks a line; no ";" in a text (it would end a step).
!$yes = "sí"
!$no = "no"
